title: "CNRS Scientific Toolkit"
message: "CNRS means Complex Numeric Representation System. Version 0.16.0 adds exact finite CNRS-A string/carrier conversion and routes string multiplication through exact convolution and Gaussian-Laurent normalization. Python is independently implemented and theorem-aligned."
